  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/02/IMG-20160227-WA0006.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 270px;\" /></p>\n<p>(8 fotos) El Centre Cultural Suera ha participat aquest dissabte, un any m&eacute;s, al preg&oacute; de les festes de la Magdalena, a Castell&oacute;, amb diverses escenes de la mostra Un poble al carrer. Encap&ccedil;alaven la comitiva l&#39;alcalde, Jos&eacute; Pascual Mart&iacute; Garcia, i la reina de les festes, Alba Lengua Garcia.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suerapregomagdalena16/img-20160227-wa0001.jpg\" alt=\"img-20160227-wa0001\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suerapregomagdalena16/img-20160227-wa0002.jpg\" alt=\"img-20160227-wa0002\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suerapregomagdalena16/img-20160227-wa0003.jpg\" alt=\"img-20160227-wa0003\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suerapregomagdalena16/img-20160227-wa0004.jpg\" alt=\"img-20160227-wa0004\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suerapregomagdalena16/img-20160227-wa0005.jpg\" alt=\"img-20160227-wa0005\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suerapregomagdalena16/img-20160227-wa0006.jpg\" alt=\"img-20160227-wa0006\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suerapregomagdalena16/img-20160227-wa0007.jpg\" alt=\"img-20160227-wa0007\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suerapregomagdalena16/img-20160227-wa0008.jpg\" alt=\"img-20160227-wa0008\" sty